 new playground filled with secrets. Complete challenging platforming trials and collect sparks to boost your power. Use them to purchase powerful upgrades or cool new costumes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"418\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815990/extras/e0cc545d5b289c67debf8976ccf5773f.poster.avif?t=1787380727\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815990/extras/e0cc545d5b289c67debf8976ccf5773f.webm?t=1787380727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815990/extras/e0cc545d5b289c67debf8976ccf5773f.mp4?t=1787380727\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Run and Gun Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refresh your mind with a completely different way to play! In specific levels, the game switches to a classic run and gun style but fully in 3D. Equip different weapons, blast through evil enemies, and enjoy non-stop arcade action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Babo And Luda Adventure is a chaotic 3D action platformer! Take control of this wild duo and embark on a crazy journey to defeat evil enemies. Master insane combat combos, explore wild environments, and gear up for action packed run and gun stages!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815990/bcf9c0b8c0d296a4df58fb003895e78f5a8969fe/header.jpg?t=1787380727", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Collectathon", "Hack and Slash", "Action-Adventure", "Character Customization", "Indie"], "developers": "Project Babo", "publishers": "Project Babo", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4815990", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 June 2026 - Demo", 